    "pin": {
      "title": "Avebury",
      "description": "Neolithic henge monument in Wiltshire, England",
      "extract": "Avebury is a Neolithic henge monument containing three stone circles, around the village of Avebury in Wiltshire, in south-west England. One of the best-known prehistoric sites in Britain, it contains the largest megalithic stone circle in the world. It is both a tourist attraction and a place of religious importance to contemporary pagans.",
